TurbSimGPU
Copyright 2026 Akaya1001

This project contains build scripts, source patches and accelerator kernels for TurbSim, the stochastic inflow
turbulence generator of OpenFAST (https://github.com/OpenFAST/openfast), Copyright National Renewable Energy
Laboratory, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No OpenFAST source code is redistributed here: the patches are applied at build time to a separately obtained
OpenFAST v3.5.3 source tree. The example TurbSim input files under examples/ were written for this project.
